	(lib_symbols)
	(text "BLOCK: linear_encoder\n\nSCOPE\n  Bogen IKP11-Z1.4-P1-V5-D1-R0.5-F1000-C1 magnetic read head interface\n  (DEC-0003). RS-422 differential A/B/Z receiver -> single-ended 3V3 into\n  TIM5 (encoder mode TI12 on A/B, CH3 input capture on Z), plus the 5 V\n  read-head supply, line termination and the 10-way 1.27 mm header\n  (IKP11 C1 connector option). 0.5 um resolution, 1 MHz/channel max.\n\nINTERFACES - the binding contract between blocks.\nReconciled against docs/FAFF-2-Electronics-Full.svg (block diagram) and\nhardware/cubemx/ARIA_SRB_FAFF_2_POC_CBs_1.ioc (MCU pin-map authority).\nNeed something not listed here? Raise it - do not invent it.\n  IN   +5V (read head V5 supply), +3V3 (receiver logic side)\n  IN   J-ENC : A+/A-, B+/B-, Z+/Z-, +5V, 0V (10-way 1.27 mm)\n  OUT  LINEAR_ENCODER_A PA0, _B PA1, _Z PA2 (3V3) -> mcu TIM5\n\nSTATUS: stub. No circuitry drawn yet - this sheet is reserved for the\nfollow-up block task that owns this file. Invoke /schematic-style before\nthe first edit, and delete this note once the block is drawn."
